      for  TokenRequest
  [x] M1042 Disable or Remove Feature or Program                    T1098.001
      Disable or remove unnecessary and potentially vulnerable software, features, or services to reduce the attack surface and prevent abuse by adversaries.
      for  AppCredentialAddition
