  [x] AML.M0043 AI Agent External Resource Lifecycle Management     AML.T0012
      Organizations should control external resources created or acquired by AI agents during execution by treating those resources as attributable, lifecycle-managed assets.
      for  TokenRequest
  [!] AML.M0039 AI Honeypots                                        AML.T0126
      Deploy monitored decoy AI services, agents, credentials, or other resources that resemble legitimate, active assets in the external or internal environment, but serve no real business or operational functions.
      for  MailboxAccess, TeamsMessageAccess, SharePointEnumeration
  [i] AML.M0020 Generative AI Guardrails                            AML.T0102
      Guardrails are safety controls placed between users, tools, and generative AI models to evaluate prompts, retrieved context, model outputs, and agent actions before they are accepted, executed, or shown to a user.
      for  Commands generated by an AI agent
